Simple Icons (CC0 1.0 Universal)
https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons

Previously used for monochrome tiles (VLC, Lutris, Heroic, OBS, mpv, htop,
PyCharm). Those tiles now use Flathub / brand color icons below so app cards
match the colorful Flathub artwork instead of a black silhouette.

brave-origin.svg is Chris's lion artwork for Brave Origin. It is not a
dashboard-icons or Simple Icons asset and must not be replaced with the
orange Brave Browser mark.

Flathub / upstream app icons
----------------------------
These tiles use each project's published app icon (the same artwork Flathub
shows). Prefer official SVG from the app source; when Flathub only publishes
PNG, wrap that PNG as a data-URI SVG:

  bottles.svg            <- bottlesdevs/Bottles scalable app icon
                            (Flathub: com.usebottles.bottles)
  boxes.svg              <- Flathub PNG for org.gnome.Boxes
  dolphin-emu.svg        <- dolphin-emu/dolphin Data/dolphin-emu.svg
                            (Flathub: org.DolphinEmu.dolphin-emu)
  extension-manager.svg  <- mjakeman/extension-manager app icon
                            (Flathub: com.mattjakeman.ExtensionManager)
  flatseal.svg           <- Flathub PNG for com.github.tchx84.Flatseal
  gear-lever.svg         <- Flathub PNG for it.mijorus.gearlever
  gparted.svg            <- GNOME gparted 48px app PNG as data-URI SVG
  heroic.svg             <- Flathub PNG for com.heroicgameslauncher.hgl
  htop.svg               <- htop-dev/htop htop.png as data-URI SVG
  localsend.svg          <- localsend logo-512.png as data-URI SVG
                            (Flathub: org.localsend.localsend_app)
  libreoffice.svg        <- LibreOffice Writer app icon (colorful suite mark;
                            official main icon is grayscale)
                            from libreoffice-still hicolor scalable SVG
  lutris.svg             <- Flathub PNG for net.lutris.Lutris
  mission-center.svg     <- Flathub PNG for io.missioncenter.MissionCenter
  mpv.svg                <- Flathub PNG for io.mpv.Mpv
  obs-studio.svg         <- Flathub PNG for com.obsproject.Studio
  ppsspp.svg             <- hrydgard/ppsspp icons/icon-512.svg
                            (Flathub: org.ppsspp.PPSSPP)
  prism-launcher.svg     <- PrismLauncher program_info app icon
                            (Flathub: org.prismlauncher.PrismLauncher)
  protonplus.svg         <- Vysp3r/ProtonPlus data/icons SVG
                            (Flathub: com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus)
  protonup-qt.svg        <- Flathub PNG for net.davidotek.pupgui2
  pycharm-community.svg  <- Flathub PNG for com.jetbrains.PyCharm-Community
  retroarch.svg          <- Flathub PNG for org.libretro.RetroArch
  sober.svg              <- vinegarhq/sober sober.svg
                            (Flathub: org.vinegarhq.Sober)
  vlc.svg                <- Flathub PNG for org.videolan.VLC
